markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Course Overview: AI Foundations Year 2 at a Glance

AI Foundations Year 2 is a year-long course built around two semesters with different jobs. Semester 1 has students build AI from the ground up in Python. Semester 2 shifts to deploying and prompting AI that already exists, using Microsoft Foundry.

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">
    <img src="https://images.code.org/5ec7d742efa4da97d9ae60b79611ef3d-image-1790625929941.png" alt="Microsoft Foundry logo" style="width: 24px; height: 24px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;"> <strong>Microsoft Foundry</strong> is Microsoft's platform for deploying, testing, and building applications with AI models that already exist. Instead of writing an AI system from scratch, like students do in Semester 1, students use Foundry to put existing models to work: prompting them, testing them, and building programs around them.
  </div>
</div>

<div role="img" aria-label="Timeline showing two semesters: Semester 1, Fundamentals, Units 1 through 6, and Semester 2, Foundry, Units 7 through 10" style="display: flex; width: 100%; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin: 20px 0 24px 0;">
  <div style="width: 50%; background: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px 12px; text-align: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">Semester 1: Fundamentals</div>
    <div style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 4px;">Units 1&ndash;6</div>
  </div>
  <div style="width: 50%; background: #1F1976; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 16px 12px; text-align: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">Semester 2: Foundry</div>
    <div style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 4px;">Units 7&ndash;10</div>
  </div>
</div>

<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;">
