      <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4E2F8; font-size: 16px;">Students build AI from the ground up: Python, logic, trained models, language, scale</td>
      <td style="padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4E2F8; font-size: 16px;">Students deploy and prompt existing AI models using Microsoft Foundry</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="background-color: #E4E2F8;">
      <th scope="row" style="padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top; font-size: 16px;">Units</th>
      <td style="padding: 12px; vertical-align: top; font-size: 16px;">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><b>&#11088;Unit 1: Logic-Based AI</b></div>
