        <div style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Unit 3: Working with Data</div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Unit 4: Making Predictions</div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Unit 5: Natural Language Processing</div>
        <div>Unit 6: AI at Scale</div>
